      "content": "hey i think i have a UTI again... it's super painful when i pee. i have some 100mg macrobid left over from last time, can i just take those to fix it? i'm kinda worried though because of my stage 3 kidney disease and don't want to mess up my kidneys more but i really cant afford a doctor visit right now.",
